                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.51/3840: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in China</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Schurman</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1922-05-27T15:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">May 27, 1922—3
                                p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>132. Department approves your taking the position indicated in your telegram No.
                    232 [<hi rendition="#italic">233</hi>], May 26, noon.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hughes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
